# Sample Configuration for ooda-tui

File: examples/config.oot

This is a sample config.oot that the user can copy to
`~/.config/ooda-tui/config.oot` and customize. Format is markdown-like
key=value per provider block.

## Multiple LLM providers connected at once

```
provider anthropic
  type        = cloud
  key         = "sk-ant-..."
  models      = ["claude-sonnet-4.5", "claude-opus-4"]

provider openai
  type        = cloud
  key         = "sk-..."
  models      = ["gpt-5", "gpt-5-mini"]

provider ollama-1
  type        = local
  url         = "http://localhost:11434"
  models      = ["llama3:70b-instruct"]

provider ollama-2
  type        = local
  url         = "http://localhost:11435"
  models      = ["qwen2.5-coder:32b"]

provider ollama-3
  type        = local
  url         = "http://localhost:11436"
  models      = ["deepseek-coder-v2:236b"]

provider ollama-4
  type        = local
  url         = "http://localhost:11437"
  models      = ["codestral:22b", "mistral-large:123b"]

provider custom
  type        = local
  url         = "https://my-llm.example.com/v1"
  key         = "..."
  models      = ["my-model"]

# Main session defaults
default_provider  = anthropic
default_model     = claude-sonnet-4.5

# Permission mode: prompt | yolo | deny
permission_mode   = prompt

# Compact threshold: 0.5 | 0.7 | 0.85 | 0 (off)
compact_threshold = 0.7

# Theme name
theme             = 1982

# Teamwork: number of agents and their provider/model assignments
teamwork_agents   = 4

teamwork_providers = [
  { provider: anthropic,  model: claude-sonnet-4.5 },
  { provider: ollama-1,   model: llama3:70b-instruct },
  { provider: ollama-2,   model: qwen2.5-coder:32b },
  { provider: ollama-4,   model: codestral:22b }
]
```

## Minimal config (single provider)

```
provider anthropic
  type        = cloud
  key         = "sk-ant-..."
  models      = ["claude-sonnet-4.5"]

default_provider  = anthropic
default_model     = claude-sonnet-4.5
permission_mode   = prompt
compact_threshold = 0.7
theme             = 1982
```

## File mode

`~/.config/ooda-tui/config.oot` is written with mode 0600 because it
contains API keys.
